FIPS-VARIANT: refuse non-approved primitives implemented by go-crypto itself
(or by circl, outside Go's FIPS 140 module) when crypto/fips140.Enabled().
Gated (internal/fipsgate; error result where the API has one, else panic):
  - eax.NewEAX*, ocb.NewOCB*  (EAX/OCB AEAD modes)
  - openpgp/elgamal Encrypt/Decrypt (ElGamal)
  - bitcurves (secp160k1..secp256k1 Koblitz curves) and brainpool (P256/384/512 r1/t1)
    curve operations, and the same curves in openpgp/internal/ecc generic curves
  - X25519 (openpgp/x25519, ecc curve25519), X448 (openpgp/x448, ecc x448),
    Ed448 (openpgp/ed448, ecc ed448) via circl
  - OpenPGP S2K Argon2 (openpgp/s2k)
  - CAST5 and Triple-DES OpenPGP ciphers (reported unsupported)
Ed25519 (approved) is moved from circl to crypto/ed25519 so it runs in Go's FIPS module.

